sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Prospective Member
    participant UI as React SPA (/register)
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth (GoTrue)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Admin as Organization Admin

    User->>UI: Selects Organization & Enters Email (user@org.edu)
    UI->>Auth: signUp({ email, password, raw_user_meta_data })
    Auth->>DB: Trigger handle_new_user()
    DB->>DB: Creates profile (verification_status = 'pending')
    Auth-->>User: Dispatches Email OTP / Activation Link

    alt User Confirms Email (OTP Token)
        User->>UI: Submits 6-digit Email OTP (/verify-email)
        UI->>Auth: verifyOtp({ email, token, type: 'signup' })
        Auth->>DB: Updates email_confirmed_at = now()
        DB->>DB: Trigger apply_domain_verification()
        DB->>DB: Normalizes email domain (split_part(email, '@', 2))
        DB->>DB: Checks allowed_domains of target organization

        alt Domain Matches Allowed List (e.g. org.edu)
            DB->>DB: Updates profile: verification_status = 'verified', verification_method = 'domain', verified_at = now()
            DB->>DB: Inserts audit_log ('member.domain_verified')
            DB->>DB: Creates in-app notification: "Verified automatically through your domain email address"
            DB-->>UI: Session established (Role: verified member)
            UI-->>User: Direct access to Walled Garden Catalog (/app/discover)
        else Non-Domain / Public Provider (e.g. gmail.com)
            DB->>DB: Leaves profile: verification_status = 'pending', verification_method = null
            DB->>DB: Notifies Admin: "New member pending verification queue"
            DB-->>UI: Session established (Role: unverified member)
            UI-->>User: Displays pending banner ("Pending verification by organization's admin")
            Admin->>UI: Opens Verification Queue (/app/institution)
            Admin->>DB: verify_member(p_user_id, p_approve)
            DB->>DB: Updates profile: verification_status = 'verified', verification_method = 'admin'
            DB-->>User: Verification Notification Dispatched
        end
    end
